  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Finely chop garlic. • In a medium saucepan, heat a dash of olive oil over medium heat. Cook half the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. • Add the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. • Add jasmine rice. Stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low. Cook for 12 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10-15 minutes.</p> <p>TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don&#39;t peek!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fb0d0527cba53bf333/step-001dfc00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While rice is cooking, trim baby broccoli and cut into thirds. Roughly chop Asian greens. • Thinly slice brown onion (see ingredients). • Cut Japanese tofu (see ingredients) into 2cm chunks.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fb0d0527cba53bf333/step-18433110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. • Cook baby broccoli and onion, tossing, until tender, 4-5 minutes</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fb0d0527cba53bf333/step-45f5a720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• To frying pan, add Asian greens and remaining garlic and the soy sauce. Cook until fragrant and wilted, 1-2 minutes. • Season with salt and pepper. Transfer veggies to a plate. Cover to keep warm.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fb0d0527cba53bf333/step-eb54c630.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Return pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. • When the oil is hot, cook tofu, turning occasionally, 4-5 minutes.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fb0d0527cba53bf333/step-67eaa840.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide Japanese-style tofu, veggies and rice between plates. • Drizzle with sesame dressing to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fb0d0527cba53bf333/step-ae142650.jpg"
    }
  ]
